{"translation-revision-date":"YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"build\/admin-dashboard.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Settings":[""],"One place for every gallery":[""],"Set lazy load once \u2014 every Lightbox block on your site follows it.":[""],"10 loading icons + your own":[""],"Material, iOS lines, ripple, grid\u2026 or upload a GIF \/ SVG loader.":[""],"Icon size & color":[""],"Match the loader to your brand.":[""],"Blur placeholder (LQIP)":[""],"A tiny blurred preview fades into the sharp image.":[""],"One-click WebP conversion":[""],"Convert every gallery image at once, with your own quality setting.":[""],"Live preview":[""],"See effect, loader, placeholder and crop before saving.":[""],"Per-gallery override":[""],"Any gallery can still use its own settings or reset to the site defaults.":[""],"Lazy Load":[""],"Load Distance":[""],"Load Delay":[""],"Responsive srcset":[""],"Thumbnail Size":[""],"Loaded Effect":[""],"Loading Icon":[""],"Color Placeholder":[""],"Crop Position":[""],"WebP Images":[""],"Lazy-load Plugin Conflict Notice":[""],"Lazy Load is free in the Lightbox block.":[""],"Set it for each gallery in the Gutenberg editor: Lightbox block \u2192 General \u2192 Lazy Load.":[""],"Watch tutorial":[""],"Try it in a new page":[""],"Pro Feature":[""],"Global Lazy Load Settings":[""],"In Lightbox Block Pro you control lazy load for all your galleries from this page \u2014 loader style, placeholder, crop and more, set once for the whole site.":[""],"Upgrade to Pro":[""],"Compare Free vs Pro":[""],"Already in your free version \u2014 per gallery":[""],"Open any Lightbox block \u2192 General \u2192 Lazy Load.":[""],"Loading, WebP, loaders":[""],"Auto Lightbox":[""],"Image & Gallery blocks, site-wide":[""],"Pagination":[""],"Load More & page numbers":[""],"Settings sections":[""],"Load More button":[""],"Show the first items, the rest on a click.":[""],"Infinite Scroll":[""],"The next items load as visitors reach the bottom.":[""],"Numbered Pages":[""],"1 2 3 \u2026 page links for very big galleries.":[""],"Items per page":[""],"Set how many items each gallery shows at a time.":[""],"\"Showing X of Y\" counter":[""],"With your own wording, e.g. \"Showing 12 of 48 photos\".":[""],"Site-wide button style":[""],"Filled or outline, your color and corner radius on every gallery.":[""],"Gallery Pagination":[""],"Big galleries stay fast and tidy: show a few items first, then the rest with a Load More button, infinite scroll or page numbers. The lightbox still browses every item.":[""],"Linked to a page":[""],"Images linked to another page or URL keep their link.":[""],"\"no-lightbox\" class":[""],"Add it in Block \u2192 Advanced \u2192 Additional CSS class.":[""],"Lightbox blocks":[""],"Images inside our own block use that block's lightbox.":[""],"Open preview lightbox":[""],"No lightbox":[""],"Image block":[""],"Gallery block":[""],"Preview lightbox":[""],"Close":[""],"Previous":[""],"Next":[""],"Site-wide":[""],"Open every Image and Gallery block image in a lightbox, old posts included. No block to insert.":[""],"Active":[""],"Off":[""],"Works with the blocks you already use":[""],"Nothing to change in your posts. WordPress's own \"Expand on click\" is turned off for these images, so only one lightbox opens. Scripts load only on pages that have such an image.":[""],"Posts & Pages":[""],"Images inside your posts and pages.":[""],"Post Images":[""],"On: single images in posts and pages open in the lightbox, also images added with the Classic editor.":[""],"Post Galleries":[""],"On: each gallery in a post or page opens as one set, with Next \/ Previous and thumbnails.":[""],"Post Featured Image":[""],"On: the featured image at the top of a post or page opens in the lightbox. In blog lists it still links to the post.":[""],"Shortcode & Widgets":[""],"Older Classic editor galleries and your sidebar or footer.":[""],"Gallery Shortcode [gallery]":[""],"On: galleries made with the [gallery] shortcode (Classic editor \u2192 Add Media \u2192 Create Gallery) open as one set.":[""],"Widget Images":[""],"On: images in sidebar and footer widgets (Image, Text and Gallery widgets) open in the lightbox.":[""],"WooCommerce":[""],"Images on your product pages.":[""],"WooCommerce is not active. These options work once it is.":[""],"Product Description Images":[""],"On: images and galleries in the product description (Description tab) open in the lightbox.":[""],"Product Gallery":[""],"On: the main product images at the top of the product page open in this lightbox instead of WooCommerce's own.":[""],"Pro":[""],"Skipped Automatically":[""],"These images are left as they are.":[""],"Live Preview":[""],"Click an image to try it.":[""],"Saving\u2026":[""],"Settings saved":[""],"Could not save. Please try again.":[""],"You have unsaved changes":[""],"All changes saved":[""],"Reset to defaults":[""],"Save Changes":[""]}}}